<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="d1" name="1 Passenger use cases">
        <mxGraphModel dx="3500" dy="2633" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="2602" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="d1t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;b&gt;SMART AIRPORT — Use Case Descriptions 1/3: Passenger-facing&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="1300" x="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c0" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-01 — Register&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger creates an account in the mobile app.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;App installed; internet available.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger opens the app and selects Register.&lt;br&gt;2. Passenger enters full name, email or phone, and a password.&lt;br&gt;3. System validates the format and checks the email or phone is not already used.&lt;br&gt;4. System checks the password against the strength rule (length, mixed characters).&lt;br&gt;5. Passenger accepts the terms and the privacy notice for biometric data.&lt;br&gt;6. System sends a verification code to the email or phone.&lt;br&gt;7. Passenger enters the code.&lt;br&gt;8. System creates the account and opens the home screen.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Email or phone already registered: system shows an error and offers Login.&lt;br&gt;4a. Weak password: system explains the rule and asks for a new one.&lt;br&gt;5a. Passenger declines the privacy notice: account is not created.&lt;br&gt;7a. Code wrong: passenger may retry up to 3 times.&lt;br&gt;7b. Code expired: system sends a new code.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Account is created and active; the passenger is signed in.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="20" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-02 — Login&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; all staff roles (role-based access)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;User signs in to use the system according to their role.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Account exists.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. User opens the app or staff terminal and enters the credentials.&lt;br&gt;2. System checks the credentials.&lt;br&gt;3. System checks the account is active and not locked.&lt;br&gt;4. System loads the user&#39;s role and permissions.&lt;br&gt;5. System opens the passenger home screen or the staff dashboard for that role.&lt;br&gt;6. System writes the sign-in to the audit log.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Wrong credentials: system shows an error; after 5 failed attempts the account is locked for a short time.&lt;br&gt;3a. Account disabled by Admin: access is refused and the user is told to contact the administrator.&lt;br&gt;5a. Session idle for too long: system signs the user out automatically.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Authenticated session with role-based access.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="700" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-03 — View flight information&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; Airline (data source)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger sees live status of their flight.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is logged in.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger opens the Flights screen.&lt;br&gt;2. System lists the flights linked to the passenger&#39;s bookings.&lt;br&gt;3. Passenger selects a flight, or searches by flight number.&lt;br&gt;4. System shows departure time, terminal, gate, status and delays.&lt;br&gt;5. System refreshes the data whenever the airport or airline updates it.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. No flight linked: system asks for the booking reference and adds the flight.&lt;br&gt;4a. Flight data unavailable: system shows the last known data with its update time.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger has current flight information.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="329" width="640" x="20" y="502" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-04 — Navigate airport&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger gets directions inside the terminal.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is logged in; location service is on.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger selects a destination (gate, check-in, bag drop, restroom, shop).&lt;br&gt;2. System locates the passenger (Wi-Fi or BLE beacons).&lt;br&gt;3. System calculates the shortest route and shows it on the indoor map.&lt;br&gt;4. System updates the route and the walking time as the passenger moves.&lt;br&gt;5. System warns the passenger when a closure or queue changes the route.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Location unavailable: passenger picks the starting point manually.&lt;br&gt;3a. Passenger needs step-free access: system gives a route without stairs.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger reaches the destination.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="329" width="640" x="700" y="502" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-05 — Receive notification&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger gets alerts about their journey.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is logged in; notifications allowed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. An event occurs (gate change, delay, boarding call, bag on belt).&lt;br&gt;2. System sends a push message (see Send notification).&lt;br&gt;3. Passenger&#39;s phone shows the message.&lt;br&gt;4. Passenger opens it.&lt;br&gt;5. System shows the full details and marks the message as read.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Push disabled: message is kept in the in-app inbox only.&lt;br&gt;3a. Passenger offline: message is delivered when the phone reconnects.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is informed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Triggered by Send notification.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="407" width="640" x="20" y="861" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-06 — Check in&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; Airline (booking data)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger confirms the flight and identity and gets a digital boarding pass.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Logged in; valid booking; check-in is open.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger selects the flight and taps Check in.&lt;br&gt;2. System asks the airline to confirm the booking and check-in status.&lt;br&gt;3. System runs Scan passport, which includes face verification.&lt;br&gt;4. System matches the passport data with the booking.&lt;br&gt;5. System assigns the seat (or confirms the airline&#39;s seat).&lt;br&gt;6. System issues a digital boarding pass (QR code) and stores it in the app.&lt;br&gt;7. System sends a confirmation to the passenger.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Booking not found or already checked in: system shows the reason.&lt;br&gt;3a. Passport or face check fails: Handle ID failure.&lt;br&gt;4a. Name mismatch with the booking: Check-in staff correct it through Handle ID failure.&lt;br&gt;6a. Check-in window closed: system tells the passenger to go to the airline desk.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is checked in and holds a boarding pass.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Scan passport. Extended by Handle ID failure.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="407" width="640" x="700" y="861" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-07 — Scan passport&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; AI system (OCR)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;System reads the passport data.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is at a kiosk or uses the app camera.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger places the passport data page in front of the scanner or camera.&lt;br&gt;2. System captures an image and checks it is sharp and complete.&lt;br&gt;3. AI reads the data (OCR of the machine-readable zone).&lt;br&gt;4. System reads the chip if the scanner supports it, and compares it with the printed data.&lt;br&gt;5. System checks the passport is not expired and matches the booking name.&lt;br&gt;6. System stores the passport photo for the face check.&lt;br&gt;7. System starts Verify face.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Image blurred or cut off: system asks to rescan; after 3 failed scans it goes to Handle ID failure.&lt;br&gt;4a. Chip data and printed data differ: passenger is sent to Handle ID failure.&lt;br&gt;5a. Passport expired: check-in is stopped and the passenger is referred to the airline.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passport data captured and matched to the booking.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Verify face.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="20" y="1298" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-08 — Verify face&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; AI system&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;System confirms the person matches the passport photo.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passport photo captured.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Camera shows a guide and captures the passenger&#39;s live face.&lt;br&gt;2. AI runs a liveness check (to reject photos or screens).&lt;br&gt;3. AI compares the live face with the passport photo.&lt;br&gt;4. System checks the match score against the set threshold.&lt;br&gt;5. System records the result and a template for the journey.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Liveness fails: system asks for another capture, then goes to Handle ID failure.&lt;br&gt;4a. Score below threshold: retry up to 3 times (glasses, mask or lighting), then Handle ID failure.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Identity confirmed. Biometric data is kept only as long as the journey needs (privacy rule).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Included by Scan passport and used again at the gate (Verify boarding).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="700" y="1298" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-09 — Register baggage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; Baggage staff&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Bag is weighed, tagged and linked to the passenger and flight.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is checked in.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger goes to bag drop and scans the boarding pass.&lt;br&gt;2. System shows the allowed bag count and weight for the ticket.&lt;br&gt;3. Bag is placed on the scale and weighed.&lt;br&gt;4. System prints the baggage tag (barcode or RFID).&lt;br&gt;5. Baggage staff or the passenger attaches the tag.&lt;br&gt;6. System links the bag ID to the passenger and flight.&lt;br&gt;7. Bag moves on the belt to screening; the app shows the first status.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Extra bag: system shows the fee and asks for payment.&lt;br&gt;3a. Overweight: passenger removes items or pays the fee.&lt;br&gt;4a. Tag print fails: Baggage staff print it manually and enter the bag ID.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Bag is registered and trackable.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="20" y="1750" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-10 — Track baggage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger; Baggage staff&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger follows the bag&#39;s status.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Bag is registered.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger opens Track baggage.&lt;br&gt;2. System reads the latest scan events (drop, screening, sorting, loaded, unloaded, on belt).&lt;br&gt;3. App shows the current status and the last location.&lt;br&gt;4. System sends a notification when the status changes.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. No scan event for a long time: bag is flagged as possibly delayed and Baggage staff are alerted.&lt;br&gt;3a. Bag flagged by screening: app shows &#39;under inspection&#39; (see Inspect flagged bags).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Current bag status is displayed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="700" y="1750" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c10" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-11 — Pass smart gate&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger boards through the automatic gate.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Checked in; security cleared; boarding is open.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger arrives at the smart gate with the boarding pass in the app.&lt;br&gt;2. Passenger scans the QR code at the reader.&lt;br&gt;3. System runs Verify boarding (AI face match).&lt;br&gt;4. System runs the border check for international flights.&lt;br&gt;5. Gate opens and the passenger walks through.&lt;br&gt;6. System records the boarding and updates the flight&#39;s boarded count.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Pass or face check fails: gate stays closed and Gate staff are alerted (Handle boarding issues).&lt;br&gt;4a. Border check refused: gate stays closed and the case goes to Border control.&lt;br&gt;5a. Passenger needs assistance: Gate staff open the manual lane.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Boarding recorded for the flight.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Verify boarding (AI face match) and Perform immigration / border check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="20" y="2156" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d1c11" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#534AB7;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#534AB7;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-12 — Claim baggage and exit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger arrives, collects the bag and leaves.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Flight has landed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger follows the app to arrival border control and completes the check.&lt;br&gt;2. App shows the baggage belt number for the flight.&lt;br&gt;3. Bags arrive on the belt and are scanned.&lt;br&gt;4. Passenger collects the bag.&lt;br&gt;5. System matches the bag tag with the passenger.&lt;br&gt;6. Passenger exits and the journey is marked complete.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1a. Border check refused: passenger is held for Border control.&lt;br&gt;3a. Bag does not arrive: passenger reports it to Baggage staff, who open a missing-bag case.&lt;br&gt;5a. Tag cannot be read: Baggage staff check the tag by hand.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Journey completed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#EEEDFE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Perform immigration / border check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="700" y="2156" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="d2" name="2 Security and staff">
        <mxGraphModel dx="2333" dy="1756" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1713" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="d2t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;b&gt;SMART AIRPORT — Use Case Descriptions 2/3: Security and staff-assisted journey&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="1300" x="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c0" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-13 — Handle ID failure (manual check)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Check-in staff; Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Staff verify identity manually when automatic checks fail.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Automatic scan or face check failed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System alerts Check-in staff and shows the reason for the failure.&lt;br&gt;2. Passenger goes to the desk.&lt;br&gt;3. Staff inspect the passport (photo, data page, signs of damage).&lt;br&gt;4. Staff compare the face with the photo.&lt;br&gt;5. Staff approve or reject in the system.&lt;br&gt;6. System records the decision, the staff ID and the time.&lt;br&gt;7. System continues the check-in if approved.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Document looks altered: staff escalate to the Security officer.&lt;br&gt;5a. Rejected: passenger is referred to the airline or border officer.&lt;br&gt;5b. Name or booking error: staff correct it with the airline, then repeat the check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Manual decision is logged.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Extends Check in.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="391" width="640" x="20" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-14 — Screen passengers and baggage&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Security officer; AI system (secondary)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Security checkpoint for people and cabin or checked bags.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is at the checkpoint; bag is registered.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger puts bags and items on the belt and walks through the scanner.&lt;br&gt;2. X-ray images of the bags are sent to the AI.&lt;br&gt;3. AI analyses the images (Detect threats).&lt;br&gt;4. Security officer reviews the images with the AI highlights.&lt;br&gt;5. Officer decides: clear or stop.&lt;br&gt;6. Cleared passenger and bag continue to the gate area.&lt;br&gt;7. System records the decision.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. AI marks a bag: officer reviews it and may send it to Inspect flagged bags.&lt;br&gt;4a. Person alarm on the scanner: officer does a manual search.&lt;br&gt;5a. Prohibited item confirmed: officer follows the airport procedure and records the case.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger and bag are cleared or held.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Extended by Detect threats and Inspect flagged bags.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="391" width="640" x="700" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-15 — Detect threats (AI)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;AI system; Security officer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;AI assists the officer by highlighting suspicious items.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;X-ray or camera images are available.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. AI receives the images from the scanners.&lt;br&gt;2. AI looks for prohibited items and unusual shapes.&lt;br&gt;3. AI highlights each finding with a confidence score.&lt;br&gt;4. System shows the highlights to the officer and raises an alert if the score is high.&lt;br&gt;5. Officer confirms or dismisses each finding.&lt;br&gt;6. System stores the officer&#39;s answer to check and improve the AI later.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Image quality too low: AI asks for a second scan.&lt;br&gt;3a. Low confidence: officer inspects the image manually.&lt;br&gt;5a. Officer disagrees with the AI: the final decision stays with the officer.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Result is shown; the human officer decides.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Extends Screen passengers and baggage.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="20" y="471" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-16 — Inspect flagged bags&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Baggage staff; Security officer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Staff physically check bags flagged by screening.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;A bag is flagged.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System alerts Baggage staff with the bag ID, location and reason.&lt;br&gt;2. Staff retrieve the bag from the line.&lt;br&gt;3. Passenger is called if the bag must be opened with them present.&lt;br&gt;4. Staff inspect the contents.&lt;br&gt;5. Staff record the result (clear, remove item, confiscate, escalate).&lt;br&gt;6. System updates the bag status and the passenger is informed through Track baggage.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Passenger cannot be reached: bag is held and the flight team is informed.&lt;br&gt;4a. Dangerous item found: escalate to the Security officer.&lt;br&gt;5a. Item can be removed: bag is cleared and returns to the line.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Bag is cleared or held.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Extends Screen passengers and baggage.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="700" y="471" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-17 — Verify boarding (AI face match)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Gate staff; AI system; Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;System validates the boarding pass and, with AI, that the person at the gate is the checked-in passenger.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is at the gate.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Passenger scans the boarding pass.&lt;br&gt;2. System checks flight, gate, seat, check-in and security status.&lt;br&gt;3. Camera captures the passenger&#39;s live face.&lt;br&gt;4. AI compares it with the identity verified at check-in.&lt;br&gt;5. System shows a valid result.&lt;br&gt;6. Gate staff see the passenger counted as boarded.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Pass invalid, wrong gate or flight closed: Handle boarding issues.&lt;br&gt;4a. Face does not match: Handle boarding issues, Gate staff check the documents.&lt;br&gt;4b. Camera cannot capture a clear face: passenger is sent to Gate staff.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passenger is counted as boarded.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Included by Pass smart gate. Extended by Handle boarding issues.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="20" y="877" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-18 — Handle boarding issues&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Gate staff; Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Staff resolve a failed boarding check.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Boarding verification failed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System alerts Gate staff with the reason.&lt;br&gt;2. Staff explain the problem to the passenger.&lt;br&gt;3. Staff check the passport and the booking.&lt;br&gt;4. Staff resolve it: reprint the pass, correct the seat, contact the airline, or deny boarding.&lt;br&gt;5. Staff record the outcome in the system.&lt;br&gt;6. System lets the passenger board if resolved.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Passenger is late and the gate is closed: airline decides on rebooking.&lt;br&gt;4a. Identity doubt: staff call the Security officer.&lt;br&gt;4b. Boarding denied: Check in and baggage teams are told so the bag can be removed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Issue is resolved or boarding is denied.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Extends Verify boarding (AI face match).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="700" y="877" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d2c6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F6E56;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#0F6E56;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-19 — Perform immigration / border check&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Border control (external); Passenger&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Government check of the passenger&#39;s travel documents.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Passport data is available.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System sends the passport data and flight details to the border system.&lt;br&gt;2. Border system checks it against its rules and lists.&lt;br&gt;3. Border officer reviews the result.&lt;br&gt;4. Officer approves or refuses.&lt;br&gt;5. Result is sent back to the gate or exit.&lt;br&gt;6. System records the decision.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Border system unavailable: passenger is sent to the manual border desk.&lt;br&gt;3a. Passenger flagged: officer interviews the passenger and decides.&lt;br&gt;4a. Refused: passenger cannot board, or cannot enter, and the airline is told.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Decision is recorded.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#E1F5EE;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Included by Pass smart gate and Claim baggage and exit.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="640" x="20" y="1283" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
    <diagram id="d3" name="3 Management and operations">
        <mxGraphModel dx="2333" dy="1756" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1728" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="d3t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;" value="&lt;b&gt;SMART AIRPORT — Use Case Descriptions 3/3: Management, emergency and operations&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="1300" x="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c0" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-20 — View Digital Twin&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Admin / IT; Airport management&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Live 3D view of the airport with device and AI data.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;User is logged in with permission.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. User opens the Digital Twin dashboard.&lt;br&gt;2. System loads the 3D model with live data from IoT devices and the AI system.&lt;br&gt;3. User selects an area, zone or device.&lt;br&gt;4. System shows status, active alerts and recent events.&lt;br&gt;5. User can filter by layer (people density, devices, incidents).&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Sensor offline: its item is shown as stale with the last update time.&lt;br&gt;4a. User lacks permission for a zone: system hides the details.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;User has a live view of operations.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="640" x="20" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-21 — Manage users and accounts&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Admin / IT&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Admin creates, edits and disables accounts and roles.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Admin is logged in.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Admin opens User management.&lt;br&gt;2. Admin searches for a user or creates a new one.&lt;br&gt;3. Admin sets the details and assigns a role (for example Gate staff).&lt;br&gt;4. System checks the role is allowed and the data is valid.&lt;br&gt;5. Admin confirms.&lt;br&gt;6. System saves the change and writes an audit log entry.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Duplicate account: system shows an error.&lt;br&gt;6a. Admin disables an account: active sessions are closed at once.&lt;br&gt;6b. Admin changes a role: new permissions apply at the next login.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Accounts and roles are up to date.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="640" x="700" y="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-22 — Manage flights and gates&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Admin / IT; Airport management&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Staff maintain flights, gates and times.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;User is logged in with permission.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. User opens Flights.&lt;br&gt;2. User adds a flight or edits the time, gate or aircraft stand.&lt;br&gt;3. System checks for conflicts (two flights at one gate or stand).&lt;br&gt;4. System saves the change.&lt;br&gt;5. System updates the passenger app and the airport screens.&lt;br&gt;6. System sends Send notification to the affected passengers.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Conflict: system shows the clash and proposes free gates or times.&lt;br&gt;4a. Change is within the notice limit: system asks for a reason before saving.&lt;br&gt;6a. Flight cancelled: notification also gives the airline&#39;s rebooking contact.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Flight data is updated and passengers are informed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Send notification.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="640" x="20" y="440" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-23 — Send notification&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Notification system (internal)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;System delivers alerts to passengers or staff.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;An event requires a message.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System receives the event and its type.&lt;br&gt;2. System selects the recipients (passengers of a flight, a zone, or a staff group).&lt;br&gt;3. System fills the message template with the event data.&lt;br&gt;4. System delivers by push, SMS or airport screen, depending on the type.&lt;br&gt;5. System logs the delivery and the time.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. No passengers match: nothing is sent.&lt;br&gt;4a. Push fails: system retries, then uses SMS or keeps the message in the in-app inbox.&lt;br&gt;4b. Emergency message: system uses all channels at once and skips quiet hours.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Recipients are informed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Included by Manage flights and gates, and Handle emergency.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="360" width="640" x="700" y="440" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-24 — Handle emergency&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Emergency team&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Team responds to fire, fall or crowd incidents.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;An incident is detected or reported.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. System raises the alert (see Detect fall / crowd incident).&lt;br&gt;2. Emergency team see the incident location on the Digital Twin with a camera snapshot.&lt;br&gt;3. Team leader accepts the alert and assigns responders.&lt;br&gt;4. System informs the nearby staff and passengers (Send notification).&lt;br&gt;5. Team reaches the scene and gives first aid or controls the crowd.&lt;br&gt;6. Team updates the status (on scene, resolved).&lt;br&gt;7. Team closes the incident and the system stores the report.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1a. Alert raised manually by staff: incident is created with the staff member&#39;s location.&lt;br&gt;2a. False alarm: team closes the incident with a note.&lt;br&gt;5a. More help needed: team calls external services (ambulance, fire brigade) and records it.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Incident is resolved and documented.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Includes Detect fall / crowd incident and Send notification.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="20" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-25 — Detect fall / crowd incident&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;AI system&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;AI finds falls or dangerous crowd density on camera feeds.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Camera streams are online.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. AI analyses the camera streams all the time.&lt;br&gt;2. AI detects a person lying on the floor for several seconds, or crowd density above the set limit.&lt;br&gt;3. AI checks the detection against its confidence level.&lt;br&gt;4. System creates an incident with location, time and a snapshot.&lt;br&gt;5. System forwards it to Handle emergency.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;3a. Low confidence: operator confirms the clip first.&lt;br&gt;3b. Camera blocked or offline: system raises a fault alert instead.&lt;br&gt;5a. Same incident already open: system adds the new data to it, without a second alert.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Incident is created.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Included by Handle emergency.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="422" width="640" x="700" y="830" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="d3c6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;overflow=fill;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BA7517;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;font-family:Helvetica;&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan=&#39;2&#39; style=&#39;background:#BA7517;color:#FFF;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;padding:5px;&#39;&gt;UC-26 — Repair equipment / report fault&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Actors&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Maintenance team&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Description&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Technician records and repairs a faulty device or piece of equipment.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Preconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Maintenance team are logged in; a fault is reported or found.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Main flow&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;1. Technician logs the fault (device, location, symptom) or receives a report.&lt;br&gt;2. System creates a ticket and assigns a priority.&lt;br&gt;3. Ticket is assigned to a technician.&lt;br&gt;4. Technician goes to the device and repairs or replaces it.&lt;br&gt;5. Technician tests the device.&lt;br&gt;6. Technician updates and closes the ticket.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Alternative flows&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;2a. Safety-critical device (for example gate or scanner): high priority, and Gate staff are told to use the manual lane.&lt;br&gt;4a. Spare part needed: ticket is marked waiting and escalated to management.&lt;br&gt;5a. Test fails: ticket stays open and goes back to step 4.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Postconditions&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;Device is working and the ticket is closed.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;width:110px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;background:#FFF4E0;&#39;&gt;Relationships&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #BBB;padding:3px 5px;&#39;&gt;None.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="376" width="640" x="20" y="1282" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>